        <item>
            <title>Version 0.8.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:50:37 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.8.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:edSignature>U8JprwsgNjpr4T9wPvovIeD/YCCsQzmn1pr8xw86JkM8N+nJQcVV2na1QBP4x+TLzAMCnOVLScpX8W5Tzz4HAA==</sparkle:edSignature>
            <description><![CDATA[Per-app audio capture: restrict subtitles to a single application (e.g. Chrome, Spotify) via Audio Source → Single App. Other apps' audio is filtered out at the ScreenCaptureKit layer, so you can translate a YouTube video without picking up notification sounds or music from another app. Selection persists by bundle ID and falls back to whole-system capture if the chosen app isn't running.]]></description>
            <enclosure
